<!--
  Workspace Playground — TravelPostcard
  FQN: org.blockml.bml.workspace.playground.TravelPostcard
-->
<block
  xmlns="http://blockml.org/bml"
  xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance"
  xsi:schemaLocation="http://blockml.org/bml https://blockml.org/schemas/bml.xsd
                      "
  xmlns:core="org.blockml.bml.core"
  xmlns:type="org.blockml.bml.type"
  xmlns:playground="org.blockml.bml.workspace.playground">

  <name>TravelPostcard</name>
  <type>playground:TravelPostcard</type>
  <baseType>core:Documentation</baseType>
  <is>A short travel postcard in English about Lisbon</is>

  <documentation>
    A structured travel postcard produced by a workspace transform execution,
    in English, about Lisbon. Each transform execution replaces this block
    with a freshly composed postcard.
  </documentation>

  <properties>
    <title type="type:Text">
      <value>A Day Among the Seven Hills</value>
    </title>
    <destination type="type:Text">
      <value>Lisbon</value>
    </destination>
    <opening type="type:Text">
      <value>Wish you were here! I'm scribbling this from a little tiled bench above the Tagus, watching the ferries draw silver lines across the water while the whole waterfront smells of salt, coffee, and roasting chestnuts.</value>
    </opening>
    <body type="type:Text">
      <value>This morning I rode the Elevador da Bica down streets so steep the houses seem to lean on one another, all pink, ochre and faded blue, while a knife-grinder's whistle echoed somewhere below.

At a marble counter in the Baixa I ate a warm pastel de nata, dusting cinnamon over the top the way the locals do, then drifted into the Feira da Ladra to haggle over an old brass compass.

Now the sun is dropping behind the 25 de Abril bridge and a busker in the square is playing fado on a twelve-string guitar. The light has turned everything to amber, and I already don't want to leave.</value>
    </body>
    <language type="type:Text">
      <value>English</value>
    </language>
    <date type="type:DateTime">
      <value>2026-09-05T20:58:17</value>
    </date>
  </properties>

</block>